      "intent": "Explore a larger optional command workspace opened by the existing shortcut, with search at top, a left group list, and compact previews for Table, Equation, Code block. For unmatched-command show clear no-results guidance. Pins: 1 categories support exploration; 2 preview describes the insertion; 3 search recovery is always available. No AI suggestion, no invented command execution.",
