      "bytes": 1089961,
      "level": "Moderate",
      "intent": "Show a searchable Insert popover with matching results for table and a separate no-results state for unmatched-command. Shared command names and short purpose descriptions connect Insert with the Action Palette; existing keyboard hints remain visible.",
